    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Let's stack everything. You walk into a restaurant at three o'clock. Hola. Quisiera una mesa, por favor. — I would like a table, please. Son las tres. You sit down. Quisiera un café y un pastel. — I would like a coffee and a cake. Cuatro euros. Gracias. You just used greetings, politeness, numbers, and time in one real transaction.",
